re Python 3.10+[5][6].\n*   **FFmpeg:** Virtually all these tools require `ffmpeg` to be installed and available in your system's PATH to extract audio from video files[3][5][6].\n*   **Hardware Acceleration:** If you have an NVIDIA GPU, using a CUDA-enabled version will provide a 5-10x performance boost compared to CPU inference[6].\n\n### Getting Started\n1.  **Install FFmpeg:** Ensure it is installed on your system (`sudo apt install ffmpeg` for Linux, `brew install ffmpeg` for macOS, or via official binaries for Windows)[5][6][7].\n2.  **Select a Tool:** For most users, installing `faster-whisper` or a wrapper like `whisper_autosrt` via `pip` is the quickest path to success[3][1].\n3.  **Run the Command:** Most tools follow a simple pattern:\n    `whisper_tool --input \"your_video.mp4\" --output \"subtitles.srt\"`[6][1]\n\nSources:\n[1] [localaimaster.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEg35Z0sejVDVk1pNWP0GjxYeBJp51mTeamhvQGwLKQq7UUA-1RhP3IwpIaB8M7Ye0mIZEg79diFZK-3-4SSMdToKSE-wBODreIGrLuUALK7zFzOxvWQXBfInxccWo1iJudn0VGHbKQBYCK67dxvRI=)\n[2] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGsRNA9g14d-ig45ORH9kE_1b2VIDGUB3Z96wsHyQ8OIDdAJPOTDUZlBWsdVDLCxFNNiRWeghHJ33KnVDiq2Sgd8Vfol5Twmn5RwG7QLe4O8hSenaQu_22C_Hxap_lUpW7s)\n[3] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8uktJR03ukCcUIf_YcYxWW8oQQw_yROwFToTzD0ZVI7_L6xnjUWM0Q1w7bZFQ1dgP8plsj_CI-KS2ya7QI3EOS1xDkEYYYK1z1VaU7YXwGBqaF2ENiJWm2hvyhpGASRboUQ==)\n[4] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8uktJR03ukCcUIf_YcYxWW8oQQw_yROwFToTzD0ZVI7_L6xnjUWM0Q1w7bZFQ1dgP8plsj_CI-KS2ya7QI3EOS1xDkEYYYK1z1VaU7YXwGBqaF2ENiJWm2hvyhpGASRboUQ==)\n[5] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5xx-19XOR4QAR-kn3dhKWByVVPeii8v_WhR7uUrAE9ruMwa42PkfTlqlGTWTLLRORkPAIf1G1FNzSW3Pi97WRWOYW2JeS2PTzt7hyPWbHTaazUugxGGC9HUBNzEo3Oga-)\n[6] [github.com](htt